{"file": "末日觉醒，我的神级选择-第183集.mp4", "ep": 183, "duration": 55.6, "segments": [{"start": 6.03, "end": 8.23, "text": "把老大的位置讓出來"}, {"start": 8.63, "end": 10.43, "text": "你躲無理想福"}, {"start": 10.63, "end": 13.23, "text": "兄弟們以後跟著異能者幹"}, {"start": 13.43, "end": 14.63, "text": "內鬥躲位"}, {"start": 16.51, "end": 17.31, "text": "你看那個"}, {"start": 17.31, "end": 18.91, "text": "子彈打上去只崩點土渣"}, {"start": 19.11, "end": 19.91, "text": "異能者"}, {"start": 19.91, "end": 20.91, "text": "體質類的"}, {"start": 22.24, "end": 22.84, "text": "是"}, {"start": 37.83, "end": 39.03, "text": "瞧下那個聚集地獄"}, {"start": 39.43, "end": 40.63, "text": "是不是黑惡勢力"}, {"start": 40.63, "end": 41.23, "text": "是"}, {"start": 41.23, "end": 41.83, "text": "是"}, {"start": 41.83, "end": 42.83, "text": "喬氏他們毀的"}, {"start": 42.83, "end": 43.63, "text": "搶了學校"}, {"start": 43.63, "end": 44.03, "text": "醫院"}, {"start": 44.03, "end": 45.23, "text": "還關了好幾十口人"}, {"start": 45.23, "end": 46.03, "text": "他們有槍"}, {"start": 46.03, "end": 46.83, "text": "有功奴"}, {"start": 46.83, "end": 47.83, "text": "還有會異能的"}, {"start": 47.83, "end": 48.43, "text": "知道了"}, {"start": 49.92, "end": 51.12, "text": "夠你們撐些日子"}, {"start": 51.32, "end": 52.12, "text": "好好活"}]}